WARD: Wow, you can see why Pharaoh chose here.

6
00:00:24,887 --> 00:00:30,593
NARRATOR: During a season of excavations, our cameras had access

7
00:00:30,693 --> 00:00:36,499
unprecedented to follow the teams at the forefront of archaeology.

8
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,370
MAN: I drive very fast for the thrill.

9
